 513:Drivers/lvgl/src/indev/lv_indev_scroll.c ****  * Search for snap point in the min..max range.
 514:Drivers/lvgl/src/indev/lv_indev_scroll.c ****  * @param obj the object on which snap point should be found
 515:Drivers/lvgl/src/indev/lv_indev_scroll.c ****  * @param min ignore snap points smaller than this. (Absolute coordinate)
 516:Drivers/lvgl/src/indev/lv_indev_scroll.c ****  * @param max ignore snap points greater than this. (Absolute coordinate)
 517:Drivers/lvgl/src/indev/lv_indev_scroll.c ****  * @param ofs offset to snap points. Useful the get a snap point in an imagined case
 518:Drivers/lvgl/src/indev/lv_indev_scroll.c ****  *            what if children are already moved by this value
 519:Drivers/lvgl/src/indev/lv_indev_scroll.c ****  * @return the absolute x coordinate of the nearest snap point
 520:Drivers/lvgl/src/indev/lv_indev_scroll.c ****  *         or `LV_COORD_MAX` if there is no snap point in the min..max range
